        <object id="overview-15" label="&lt;b&gt;Historical visual + event&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Separate 8-frame blocks per source&lt;br&gt;Up to 256 visual + 8 event leaves&lt;br&gt;Each token has 256 features&lt;br&gt;Shared metadata adapter" tooltip="Historical visual + event&#10;Separate 8-frame blocks per source&#10;Up to 256 visual + 8 event leaves&#10;Each token has 256 features&#10;Shared metadata adapter" link="data:page/id,encoders">
