        <object id="context-14" label="&lt;b&gt;Current auxiliary tokens · three separate branches&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;State: 15 observed + 8 preceding action + 1 availability = 24&lt;br&gt;Previous-joint input: enabled in the core configuration&lt;br&gt;When disabled: zero 7 joints; retain gripper + availability.&lt;br&gt;Linear 24 → 256 → SiLU → Linear 256 → 256  ⇒  1 token&lt;br&gt;Goal: pooled text encoder output  ⇒  1 token&lt;br&gt;Clock: [conditioning, execution] / 100 → Linear 2 → 256  ⇒  1 token&lt;br&gt;These three tokens bypass the metadata adapter.&lt;br&gt;Concatenate with ≤32 adapted current visual tokens." tooltip="policy.py and batched_policy.py share the current-state projection. model.condition_on_previous_joint_commands controls current and historical command inputs together. Observed joint angles, TCP pose, measured gripper state and all prediction targets remain.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
