        <object id="context-17" label="&lt;b&gt;Valid context length · before padding&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Lvalid ≤ 33(Hc + He) + 35&lt;br&gt;Each historical frame: ≤32 visual + 1 event token&lt;br&gt;Each full 8-frame block: ≤256 visual + 8 event = 264&lt;br&gt;Current/auxiliary: ≤32 visual + 3&lt;br&gt;Teacher retains all causal history; budget=128 is for later readers." tooltip="Valid context length · before padding&#10;Lvalid ≤ 33(Hc + He) + 35&#10;Each historical frame: ≤32 visual + 1 event token&#10;Each full 8-frame block: ≤256 visual + 8 event = 264&#10;Current/auxiliary: ≤32 visual + 3&#10;Teacher retains all causal history; budget=128 is for later readers.">
