        <mxCell id="current-9" value="CHRONOTREE  /  Current-only diagnostic experiment     •     Click page tabs or linked blocks · hover for details · all shapes are editable" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#64748B;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1862" width="1690" height="30" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="current-10" value="01  ONE OBSERVED FRAME · CURRENT VISUAL ENCODING ONLY" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#475569;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="225" width="1704" height="35" />
        </mxCell>
        <object id="current-11" label="&lt;b&gt;Current front + wrist RGB-D&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only the latest observation at a decision.&lt;br&gt;Combine calibrated visible points from both views.&lt;br&gt;≤2048 XYZRGB points; same balanced sampler.&lt;br&gt;Frozen CLIP RN50 layer1 → 256 features/point.&lt;br&gt;Training reuses aligned FP16 feature sidecars.&lt;br&gt;Visible robot pixels and calibration remain." tooltip="One current frame is consumed. Previous execution observations and the reset conditioning video are omitted by this explicitly separate ablation. Simulator state and cube poses are not policy inputs.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="285" width="500" height="300" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="current-12" label="&lt;b&gt;Same current-scene visual encoder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Descriptor LayerNorm + Linear: 256 → 128.&lt;br&gt;XYZRGB + descriptor → 134-value point input.&lt;br&gt;Point MLP: 134 → 256 → 256.&lt;br&gt;Edge MLP + spatial Gaussian local pooling.&lt;br&gt;≤32 balanced observed-point centers.&lt;br&gt;Single-frame offsets: Δt = 0; no temporal pool." tooltip="The current branch reuses SpacetimeEncoder's point/edge machinery. No historical block is loaded, packed, encoded or read; raw_tau_t is inactive because every neighbor belongs to the current frame.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="640" y="285" width="500" height="300" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="current-13" label="&lt;b&gt;Current visual metadata&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Keep observed anchor XYZ and spatial bounds.&lt;br&gt;Keep constant source/type/resolution metadata.&lt;br&gt;Absolute time and relative-age fields are zero.&lt;br&gt;No history length or episode clock reaches policy.&lt;br&gt;Shared content + metadata adapter, LayerNorm.&lt;br&gt;Output: ≤32 × 256 valid visual tokens." tooltip="The 23-field metadata layout is retained, but its four absolute/relative temporal fields are fixed to zero. Spatial metadata comes solely from the observed point cloud. No measured TCP metadata is present.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1232" y="285" width="520" height="300" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <mxCell id="current-14" value="current points" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="current-11" target="current-12">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="current-15" value="pooled tokens" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="current-12" target="current-13">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="current-16" value="02  SAME ACTION DECODER · FIXED-SIZE VISUAL + TASK CONTEXT" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#475569;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="630" width="1704" height="35" />
        </mxCell>
        <object id="current-17" label="&lt;b&gt;Supplied task-goal text&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The available instruction; no hidden task ID.&lt;br&gt;Same trainable byte-level text encoder.&lt;br&gt;Byte/position embeddings + two Transformer layers.&lt;br&gt;One pooled goal token of width 256.&lt;br&gt;No subgoals, target poses or future observations." tooltip="Supplied task-goal text&#10;The available instruction; no hidden task ID.&#10;Same trainable byte-level text encoder.&#10;Byte/position embeddings + two Transformer layers.&#10;One pooled goal token of width 256.&#10;No subgoals, target poses or future observations.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="690" width="500" height="300" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="current-18" label="&lt;b&gt;Decoder context&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;≤32 current visual tokens + one goal token.&lt;br&gt;At most 33 valid tokens per decision.&lt;br&gt;No state, command, event or clock token.&lt;br&gt;No conditioning or execution history tokens.&lt;br&gt;Padding excluded from cross-attention.&lt;br&gt;Context size does not grow with episode age." tooltip="Decoder context&#10;≤32 current visual tokens + one goal token.&#10;At most 33 valid tokens per decision.&#10;No state, command, event or clock token.&#10;No conditioning or execution history tokens.&#10;Padding excluded from cross-attention.&#10;Context size does not grow with episode age.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="640" y="690" width="500" height="300" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="current-19" label="&lt;b&gt;Unchanged conditional action flow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4 decoder layers, 8 heads, width 256.&lt;br&gt;Action self-attention + context cross-attention + FFN.&lt;br&gt;H=16 absolute joint/gripper targets; [B, 16, 8].&lt;br&gt;8 Euler evaluations from paired Gaussian noise.&lt;br&gt;10 Hz targets: hold each for 2 native steps.&lt;br&gt;Execute 2 targets, then acquire current and replan." tooltip="Unchanged conditional action flow&#10;4 decoder layers, 8 heads, width 256.&#10;Action self-attention + context cross-attention + FFN.&#10;H=16 absolute joint/gripper targets; [B, 16, 8].&#10;8 Euler evaluations from paired Gaussian noise.&#10;10 Hz targets: hold each for 2 native steps.&#10;Execute 2 targets, then acquire current and replan." link="data:page/id,decoder">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1232" y="690" width="520" height="300" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <mxCell id="current-20" value="current visual" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="current-13" target="current-18">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="1492" y="615" />
              <mxPoint x="890" y="615" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="current-21" value="goal" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="current-17" target="current-18">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="current-22" value="≤33 tokens" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#475569;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="current-18" target="current-19">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
        </mxCell>
        <object id="current-23" label="&lt;b&gt;History and state removal are structural&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;model.history_mode = none (default elsewhere remains full).&lt;br&gt;No historical event encoder, state MLP or clock projection.&lt;br&gt;No historical blocks or frozen descriptors read by workers.&lt;br&gt;Online reset/step retains only the current observation.&lt;br&gt;All previous commands, including gripper/availability, excluded.&lt;br&gt;No measured joints, TCP pose or gripper state enters the model.&lt;br&gt;Changing history, clocks or numerical state must not change output." tooltip="The empty archive placeholder only preserves interface compatibility. This is not a full history encoder whose output is discarded. Training and deployment share the same current-only contract.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1050" width="804" height="320" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="current-24" label="&lt;b&gt;Separate two-H200 training recipe&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Single node, one torchrun agent, two DDP workers.&lt;br&gt;Effective batch 128; microbatch 64/GPU.&lt;br&gt;One local pass per optimizer update with both GPUs.&lt;br&gt;AdamW, peak LR 0.0001; 100,000 optimizer steps.&lt;br&gt;Activation checkpointing off; decoder and flow loss unchanged.&lt;br&gt;Reuse prepared_balanced_v2 and existing CLIP feature sidecars.&lt;br&gt;Memory/throughput on H200s must be measured after launch." tooltip="Separate two-H200 training recipe&#10;Single node, one torchrun agent, two DDP workers.&#10;Effective batch 128; microbatch 64/GPU.&#10;One local pass per optimizer update with both GPUs.&#10;AdamW, peak LR 0.0001; 100,000 optimizer steps.&#10;Activation checkpointing off; decoder and flow loss unchanged.&#10;Reuse prepared_balanced_v2 and existing CLIP feature sidecars.&#10;Memory/throughput on H200s must be measured after launch.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="930" y="1050" width="822" height="320" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="current-25" label="&lt;b&gt;Interpretation: visual grounding diagnostic, not a replacement for the memory benchmark&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This fresh policy deliberately lacks the supplied conditioning video and all episode history. Some RoboMME tasks require that information.&lt;br&gt;Inspect first approach/grasp and sensitivity to cube position separately from full task success. Failure cannot by itself rule out the architecture.&lt;br&gt;The full-history teacher, exact TREE/FLAT leaf coverage and matched supervision stay unchanged. This is also distinct from the compact CURRENT reader." tooltip="Interpretation: visual grounding diagnostic, not a replacement for the memory benchmark&#10;This fresh policy deliberately lacks the supplied conditioning video and all episode history. Some RoboMME tasks require that information.&#10;Inspect first approach/grasp and sensitivity to cube position separately from full task success. Failure cannot by itself rule out the architecture.&#10;The full-history teacher, exact TREE/FLAT leaf coverage and matched supervision stay unchanged. This is also distinct from the compact CURRENT reader.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1430" width="1704" height="180" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="current-26" label="&lt;b&gt;Parameter accounting&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5,887,881 active trainable policy parameters; 1 inactive stored parameters; 5,887,882 total.&lt;br&gt;Frozen external RGB encoder: 244,576 parameters. Counts exclude optimizer state, activations and CUDA workspace." tooltip="Parameter accounting&#10;5,887,881 active trainable policy parameters; 1 inactive stored parameters; 5,887,882 total.&#10;Frozen external RGB encoder: 244,576 parameters. Counts exclude optimizer state, activations and CUDA workspace.">
          <mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#0F172A;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1660" width="1704" height="140" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
